    "isSimulated": false,
    "title": "Ratchet and Clank - Galactic Cruise",
    "description": "Good friends, good music, and a... decent ship. What more could you need? Ratchet, Clank, and the ship all have customization options.\nThe planet that the ship orbits around can be swapped out for different ones. You can also customize the clouds swirling around the planet.\nYou can also toggle whether or not Captain Qwark is in the scene.\n\nThe video that Clank is watching can be replaced with an image, GIF, or MP4 video of your choice.\n\nThere's also the option to select which song plays in the background or choose to shuffle them all.\n\nSpecial thanks to DemonBoy and Nooga for ripping these Ratchet & Clank models and to Peardian for the background scenery.\n\nThe planet models were created by Feivelyn.\n\nAlso thanks to rootkitwolf ,OMGparticles, and Gariam for the clock/Free Camera, audio bars, and layer parenting code, respectively.\n\nSource games:\nRatchet & Clank | Ratchet & Clank: Going Commando | Ratchet & Clank: Up Your Arsenal | Ratchet: Deadlocked | Sonic Colors",
